| Publication search | ~10 lines | DOM: `#pubSearch` |
| Citation sparkline canvas | ~45 lines | DOM: `#citationChart` |
| Chart re-draw on theme change | ~3 lines | Existing theme toggle |
| `aria-pressed` on filter btns | ~4 lines | Existing filter code |

Total new JS: approximately 140 lines, bringing `main.js` to ~225 lines — still compact and maintainable.

